{"id": "46d9192f-c908-4248-9d5b-effef8294910", "question": "what does the protein that this table is about do?", "status": "ok", "num_iterations": 1, "total_delta_f": 0.999999995, "total_step_score": 0.999999995, "trajectory_quality_score": 0.999999995, "steps": [{"iteration_index": 1, "retrieval_action": "text_retrieval_result", "retrieval_type": "Text Retrieval", "mode": "text_retrieval", "previous_query_for_similarity": null, "query": "function of hemoglobin", "query_similarity_enabled": true, "query_similarity_with_previous": null, "similarity_threshold": 0.85, "fact_similarity_threshold": 0.9, "retrieval_index": 3, "reaction_index": 4, "reaction_action": "thought", "reaction_text": "Based on the retrieved documents, hemoglobin is a protein in red blood cells that primarily functions to transport oxygen from the lungs to the rest of the body. It also has non-oxygen-carrying functions as an antioxidant and a regulator of iron metabolism in certain tissues.\n</Thought>", "facts_t": ["Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as an antioxidant outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in macrophages outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in alveolar cells outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in mesangial cells in the kidney."], "filtered_facts_t": ["Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as an antioxidant outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in macrophages outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in alveolar cells outside the brain.", "Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as a regulator of iron metabolism in mesangial cells in the kidney."], "accepted_facts_t": ["Hemoglobin has non-oxygen-carrying functions as an antioxidant outside the brain.",