oning explicitly uses the opening date from the retrieved evidence but states that another piece of information (the mayor in 1914) is still needed.", "step_score": 0.0}, {"iteration_index": 3, "retrieval_action": "text_retrieval_result", "retrieval_type": "Text Retrieval", "mode": "text_retrieval", "previous_query_for_similarity": "Manhattan Municipal Building opening date\"", "query": "mayor of New York City in 1914\"", "query_similarity_enabled": true, "query_similarity_with_previous": 0.5772181656481624, "similarity_threshold": 0.85, "fact_similarity_threshold": 0.9, "retrieval_index": 11, "reaction_index": 12, "reaction_action": "thought", "reaction_text": "The mayor of New York City in 1914 was John Purroy Mitchel. The Manhattan Municipal Building, which opened in 1914, was criticized by Mayor John Purroy Mitchel for the usage of space in the building.\n</Thought>\nFinal Answer: The mayor of New York City when the Manhattan Municipal Building opened in 1914 was John Purroy Mitchel.", "facts_t": ["John Purroy Mitchel became Mayor in 1914.", "Mayor John Purroy Mitchel criticized the usage of space in the Manhattan Municipal Building as 'wasteful'.", "Some city departments that were scheduled to move into the Manhattan Municipal Building found space elsewhere.", "Other city departments received less space in the Manhattan Municipal Building compared to their previous quarters."], "filtered_facts_t": ["John Purroy Mitchel became Mayor in 1914.", "Mayor John Purroy Mitchel criticized the usage of space in the Manhattan Municipal Building as 'wasteful'."], "accepted_facts_t": ["John Purroy Mitchel became Mayor in 1914.", "Mayor John Purroy Mitchel criticized the usage of space in the Manhattan Municipal Building as 'wasteful'."], "delta_f": 0.999999995, "novel_facts": ["John Purroy Mitchel became Mayor in 1914.", "Mayor John Purroy Mitchel criticized the usage of space in the Manhattan Municipal Building as 'wasteful'."], "fact_novelty_matches": [{"fact": "John Purroy Mitchel became Mayor in 1914.", "is_novel": true, "duplicate_scope": null, "matched_fact": null, "matched_similarity": null}, {"fact": "Mayor John Purroy Mitchel criticized the usage of space in the Manhattan Municipal Building as 'wasteful'.", "is_novel": true, "duplicate_scope": null, "matched_fact": null, "matched_similarity": null}], "cumulative_fact_count_after_dedup": 2, "delta_reason": "set_difference", "utility_label": "full_contribution", "utility": 1.0, "utility_reason": "The reasoning states that the evidence fully identifies the mayor and associates him with the event year, resolving the subproblem.", "step_score": 0.999999995}]}
