{"id": "1a0ad027-ab14-468f-977d-327a2a8f9fd9", "question": "solve for x in this equation.", "status": "ok", "num_iterations": 2, "total_delta_f": 0.0, "total_step_score": 0.0, "trajectory_quality_score": 0.0, "steps": [{"iteration_index": 1, "retrieval_action": "no_retrieval_result", "retrieval_type": "Text Retrieval", "mode": "no_retrieval", "previous_query_for_similarity": null, "query": "No Retrieval.", "query_similarity_enabled": true, "query_similarity_with_previous": null, "similarity_threshold": 0.85, "fact_similarity_threshold": 0.9, "retrieval_index": 3, "reaction_index": 4, "reaction_action": "thought", "reaction_text": "To solve the equation 2x - 3 = -7, we need to isolate x. First, we add 3 to both sides of the equation to get rid of the -3 on the left side. Then, we divide both sides by 2 to solve for x.\n</Thought>", "facts_t": [], "filtered_facts_t": [], "accepted_facts_t": [], "delta_f": 0.0, "novel_facts": [], "fact_novelty_matches": [], "cumulative_fact_count_after_dedup": 0, "delta_reason": "no_contribution", "utility_label": "no_contribution", "utility": 0.0, "utility_reason": "The next reasoning text clearly indicates that there is no retrieval performed and solves the equation using algebraic manipulation without referencing any facts from retrieval.", "step_score": 0.0}, {"iteration_index": 2, "retrieval_action": "no_retrieval_result", "retrieval_type": "Text Retrieval", "mode": "no_retrieval", "previous_query_for_similarity": "No Retrieval.", "query": "No Retrieval.", "query_similarity_enabled": true, "query_similarity_with_previous": 1.0, "similarity_threshold": 0.85, "fact_similarity_threshold": 0.9, "retrieval_index": 7, "reaction_index": 8, "reaction_action": "thought", "reaction_text": "To solve the equation 2x - 3 = -7, we start by adding 3 to both sides of the equation to isolate the term with x:\n\\[ 2x - 3 + 3 = -7 + 3 \\]\nThis simplifies to:\n\\[ 2x = -4 \\]\nNext, we divide both sides by 2 to solve for x:\n\\[ \\frac{2x}{2} = \\frac{-4}{2} \\]\nThis simplifies to:\n\\[ x = -2 \\]\n</Thought>\n<Final Answer>\nThe solution to the equation 2x - 3 = -7 is x = -2.\n</Final Answer>", "facts_t": [], "filtered_facts_t": [], "accepted_facts_t": [], "delta_f": 0.0, "novel_facts": [], "fact_novelty_matches": [], "cumulative_fact_count_after_dedup": 0, "delta_reason": "similarity_gate", "utility_label": "no_contribution", "utility": 0.0, "utility_reason": "Similarity gate triggered because query similarity exceeded the threshold.", "step_score": 0.0}]}
